          "system__conversation_history": "{\"x-elevenlabs-history\": true, \"entries\": [{\"role\": \"user\", \"message\": \"Hi. I ordered a pressure cooker last week, and it still hasn't arrived. It was supposed to come on Friday.\"}, {\"role\": \"agent\", \"message\": \"[apologetic] I am so sorry for the delay with your order. There is a backlog at the Bhiwandi sorting hub with Delhivery, so your Hawkins five-litre pressure cooker is now expected to arrive by Wednesday, seven October, by nine pm.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"message\": \"The order number is KRT47091352.\"}, {\"role\": \"agent\", \"message\": \"Thank you. Yes, for order number [slow] K R T four seven zero nine, one three five two, the updated delivery date is this Wednesday, seven October, by nine pm. If it does not reach you by then, you can cancel for a full refund of two thousand three hundred forty rupees to your U P I account.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"message\": \"Sorry, can you give me the new delivery date once more? I'm writing it down.\"}, {\"role\": \"agent\", \"message\": \"Sure, the new delivery date is [slow] Wednesday, seven October, by nine pm. Please let me know once you have noted it down.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"message\": \"And if it doesn't come by then, can I cancel and get my money back?\"}, {\"role\": \"agent\", \"message\": \"Yes, absolutely. If it does not arrive by Wednesday, you can cancel, and the full amount of two thousand three hundred forty rupees will be refunded to your U P I account within five to seven working days.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"message\": \"Okay, thank you.\"}, {\"role\": \"agent\", \"message\": \"You are [happy] most welcome! Is there anything else I can assist you with today?\"}]}",
